from lesson_helpers import example as ex
DATA={
'sha':'062016d6fa4ca0844d1f976aa91bcf23bd070f2d','colour':'#b57820','first':'ReusableScenario',
'subtitle':('把初态、任务、时间与环境写成可复用的实验条件','Make initial states, missions, timing and environment reusable experimental conditions'),
'intro':[
('ScenarioLibrary 将实验外部条件与本体机理分开：初始化记录描述开始状态，剖面和工况模块产生计划输入，时间模块限定阶段与事件，环境模块提供外生条件或明确的物理边界。它有助于让不同本体在相同条件下进行可解释比较。','ScenarioLibrary separates experimental conditions from host mechanisms. Initialisation records describe starting states, profile and operating blocks generate planned inputs, timing blocks define phases and events, and environmental components provide exogenous conditions or explicit physical boundaries. This supports interpretable comparisons under shared conditions.'),
('本指南的核心是“绑定”：有一个场景对象并不意味着本体已经受它驱动。初始化字段必须绑定到 start/fixed，计划信号必须连接到本体输入，物理环境端口必须接入网络。','The central concept is binding. Declaring a scenario object does not mean that it drives the host. Initialisation fields must be bound to start/fixed, planned signals connected to host inputs, and physical boundary ports connected into the network.')],
'route':[
('先运行 ReusableScenario，看一个任务输入如何同时驱动两个独立本体。','Run ReusableScenario to see one planned input drive two independent hosts.'),
('阅读机械与电热初始化案例，逐字段理解 start 与 fixed 的绑定。','Read the mechanical and electrical–thermal initialisation examples and trace each start/fixed binding.'),
('学习绝对时间表、阶段局部时间和重复事件，特别检查边界时刻。','Study absolute schedules, phase-local time and repeated events, especially boundary instants.'),
('最后加入环境条件，在独立研究包中组织完整任务并记录全部设置。','Add environmental conditions last and organise a complete, recorded mission in a separate study package.')],
'concepts':[
(('初始化记录是数据，不是施加初态的执行器','Initialisation records are data, not state actuators'),'ElectricalState、ThermalState 等 record 保存初值与固定标志。只有把字段写进本体组件的修饰项，例如 v(start=state.v_start,fixed=state.fixedV)，才会影响该组件初始化；也不能同时固定过多相互依赖的状态。','Records such as ElectricalState and ThermalState store values and fixed flags. They affect initialisation only when bound into host modifiers, for example v(start=state.v_start,fixed=state.fixedV). Avoid overconstraining dependent initial states.'),
(('初始猜测与固定初值不同','A start guess is not a fixed initial condition'),'fixed=true 通常把 start 值作为初始化约束，fixed=false 允许求解器结合其他方程确定初值。具体变量的初始化还受本体方程、状态选择与 initType 影响；不能只看到 start 就声称初态已被强制。','fixed=true generally imposes the start value as an initial constraint, whereas fixed=false permits initialisation to determine it from other equations. Host equations, state selection and initType also matter; start alone is not evidence that an initial state is imposed.'),
(('绝对时间、局部时间和可暂停任务时间不同','Absolute, local and pausable mission time differ'),'绝对时间表直接以仿真 time 为坐标；LocalClock 从参考时刻或触发沿计时；MissionClock 可按其接口暂停。把某一时钟暂停，不会自动暂停所有使用绝对 time 的其他模块。','Absolute schedules use simulation time. LocalClock measures elapsed time from a reference or trigger; MissionClock supports pausing through its own interface. Pausing one clock does not automatically pause components that still use absolute time.'),
(('半开窗口和右连续表的边界必须明确','Declare half-open and right-continuous boundaries'),'TimeWindow 及阶段窗口通常采用 [开始,结束)，因此结束时刻已经退出。分段常量、命令与模式表在边界采用新值；表的 n、times 和 values 长度必须一致，时间应按具体类的契约有序。','TimeWindow and phase windows generally use [start,end), so the end instant is outside. Piecewise-constant, command and mode schedules take the new value at a boundary. Match n, times and values and respect the class-specific ordering contract.'),
(('计划结束不等于物理目标完成','A completed plan is not a completed physical objective'),'PhaseSchedule.completed 说明时间轴走完，不说明本体已经停稳或达标。环境 Temperature 的 y 是信号，而 FluidReservoir 等带物理端口的模型会参与网络方程。必须区分计划事实和本体证据。','PhaseSchedule.completed means the timetable has ended, not that the plant is settled or compliant. Environment.Temperature.y is a signal, whereas a physically connected FluidReservoir participates in network equations. Distinguish plan status from plant evidence.')],
'groups':[
('Initialization',('初始条件记录','Initial-condition records'),'声明 parameter record 并明确填写初值与 fixed 标志，再把每个字段绑定到相应本体状态。检查电气、机械、热和流体状态之间是否独立，避免重复初始化约束。','Declare a parameter record, populate initial values and fixed flags, and bind each field to the intended host state. Check independence between electrical, mechanical, thermal and fluid states to avoid redundant initial constraints.'),
('Profiles',('可复用计划曲线','Reusable planned profiles'),'选择阶跃、斜坡、正弦、分段或周期模型，设置幅值、时间与持续时间，并把 y 连到名义任务输入。使用同一实例分发给多个本体可以保证输入一致，但本体内部状态仍独立。','Choose a step, ramp, sine, piecewise or periodic profile; set amplitude and timing and connect y to the nominal mission input. Fan-out from one instance ensures a shared input while host states remain independent.'),
('Operating',('任务工况与命令','Operating conditions and commands'),'为负荷、功率、模式、阀开度、位置移动或转速扫描选择具体语义的模块；确认输出单位与本体输入一致。模式编号和运行标志只是声明的接口约定，不会自动切换未连接的控制器。','Select a semantically appropriate load, power, mode, valve, position or speed-sweep component and match units to the host input. Mode identifiers and operating flags are interface conventions; they do not switch an unconnected controller.'),
('Timing',('阶段、窗口与事件','Phases, windows and events'),'先明确绝对还是局部时间，再选择阶段调度、局部时钟、事件序列或驻留触发。连接 phaseIndex、localTime、eventCount 等实际输出；检查重触发、终止、暂停和边界处理。','Choose absolute or local time before selecting phase scheduling, clocks, event sequences or dwell qualification. Connect the actual phaseIndex, localTime or eventCount outputs and check retriggering, termination, pausing and boundaries.'),
('Environment',('外生环境与物理边界','Exogenous environment and physical boundaries'),'使用温度、压力、重力、坡度、风速和辐照等声明条件。信号类要继续绑定到本体边界组件；物理端口类要接入本体网络。Atmosphere 的有效范围与假设应由其源码断言确认。','Use declared temperature, pressure, gravity, grade, wind and irradiance conditions. Signal sources must drive a host boundary component; physical-port models must join the network. Check Atmosphere assumptions and validity against its source assertions.')],
'examples':{
'ReusableScenario':ex(('同一场景驱动两个本体','One scenario drives two hosts'),('怎样确保不同动态本体接受完全相同的任务输入？','How can two dynamic hosts receive exactly the same planned input?'),('一个 Ramp 从 0.5 s 开始、1.5 s 内增加 1，同时驱动 T=0.2 和 T=0.5 的两个一阶环节，两者初值均为零。','One Ramp starts at 0.5 s and rises by 1 over 1.5 s. It drives two first-order hosts with T=0.2 and T=0.5, both starting at zero.'),('scenario.y 在 2 s 达到 1；fastResponse 比 slowResponse 更快跟随，但二者最终都趋近同一输入。比较相位滞后时不要把不同初值混入实验。','scenario.y reaches 1 at 2 s. fastResponse tracks more rapidly than slowResponse, while both approach the same final input. Do not confound the response comparison with different initial states.'),['scenario.y','fastResponse','slowResponse'],('只把 scenario.duration 改为 3，再比较两个本体的跟踪差异。','Change only scenario.duration to 3 and compare the two tracking responses.'),('统一输入不意味着两个本体具有相同参数或状态；这里只比较不同时间常数。','A common input does not imply identical parameters or states; this example compares time constants.')),
'MechanicalInitialization':ex(('独立机械状态的初始化绑定','Binding independent mechanical initial states'),('record 中的值如何成为本体初始条件？','How do record fields become host initial conditions?'),('平动 record 指定 s=0.1、v=0，转动 record 指定 phi=0.2、w=0；这些字段直接绑定到独立质量和惯量的 start/fixed。弹簧分别为 c=10 和 c=8。','The translational record specifies s=0.1 and v=0; the rotational record specifies phi=0.2 and w=0. These fields are bound directly to independent mass and inertia start/fixed modifiers, with spring stiffnesses 10 and 8.'),('两个本体从非零弹簧变形释放，产生各自振荡。这里没有阻尼器，不应期待波形自动衰减；首先读取 t=0 的实际解检查初态。','Both hosts release from non-zero spring deformation and oscillate independently. No damper is connected, so decay is not expected. Inspect the actual t=0 solution before interpreting the motion.'),['translationalHost.s','translationalHost.v','rotationalHost.phi','rotationalHost.w'],('把 translation.s_start 改为 0.05，比较振幅；另做 fixedS=false 的实验并检查初始化方程如何确定 s。','Change translation.s_start to 0.05 and compare amplitude. In a separate fixedS=false experiment, inspect how initialisation determines s.'),('这些状态彼此独立；复杂机构不能随意固定所有连接处的位置和速度。','These states are independent. A constrained mechanism cannot arbitrarily fix every connected position and velocity.')),
'ElectricalThermalInitialization':ex(('电压、电流与温度的独立初态','Independent voltage, current and temperature initial states'),('如何在不同物理域复用初态记录而不制造网络耦合？','How can initialisation records serve different domains without coupling their networks?'),('电容初压 5 V，电感初流 0.2 A，热容初温 310 K。RC、RL 和热网络相互独立；源电压为零，环境 300 K。','The capacitor starts at 5 V, the inductor at 0.2 A and the thermal capacity at 310 K. RC, RL and thermal networks are independent; electrical sources are zero and ambient is 300 K.'),('电容电压、电感电流向零衰减，温度向 300 K 衰减。参数给出的时间常数分别为 0.1 s、0.01 s 和 50 s，因此同一横轴上快慢尺度明显不同。','Voltage and current decay towards zero and temperature towards 300 K. The declared parameters give time constants 0.1 s, 0.01 s and 50 s, producing very different time scales on one axis.'),['capacitor.v','inductor.i','thermal.T'],('把初温改为 320 K，不改变 C/G；比较初始温差与衰减时间尺度。','Change initial temperature to 320 K without changing C/G and separate initial difference from decay time scale.'),('共同 record 不表示电容与电感在同一电路，也不表示电损耗已耦合到这个热容。','A shared record does not place the electrical components in one circuit or couple their losses to this thermal capacity.')),
'EnvironmentalConditions':ex(('大气与计划环境信号','Atmosphere and planned environmental signals'),('环境数值如何生成，又有哪些量需要继续接入本体？','How are environmental values generated and which require further host connections?'),('海拔 0、1000 和 5000 m 分别驱动三个 Atmosphere；其他模块输出 300 K、101325 Pa、5°坡度重力分量和 x 向 2 m/s 风。','Altitudes 0, 1000 and 5000 m drive three Atmosphere instances. Other components provide 300 K, 101325 Pa, the gravity component of a 5-degree slope and 2 m/s wind along x.'),('随高度增加，大气压力下降；坡道以向上为正时，重力沿坡分量为负。温度、压力和风的 readback 在当前常值配置中不变化。','Pressure decreases with altitude. With uphill defined as positive, the along-slope gravity component is negative. The temperature, pressure and wind readbacks remain constant in this configuration.'),['seaPressure','hillPressure','upperPressure','temperatureReadback','pressureReadback','gradeReadback','windReadback'],('改变 grade.alpha 的符号，确认重力方向；再把环境表改成随时间变化的两个值。','Reverse the sign of grade.alpha and check gravity direction, then introduce a two-value time-varying environment profile.'),('生成风速数值并不会自动产生气动力；还需把它接到本体的受力关系。','Generating wind velocity does not automatically create aerodynamic force; connect it to the host force relation.')),
'LoadAndCommandSchedules':ex(('共享绝对时钟的负荷、命令和模式','Load, command and mode on a shared absolute clock'),('怎样让不同类型的任务输入在相同边界切换？','How can different mission inputs change on common boundaries?'),('负荷表 times={0,1,3,5}、values={0,1,1,0}；命令在 1 s 变真、5 s 变假；模式从 0 切到 2 再切回 0。','Load uses times={0,1,3,5} and values={0,1,1,0}. The command becomes true at 1 s and false at 5 s; mode changes from 0 to 2 and back to 0.'),('默认负荷插值呈上升、保持、下降；命令和模式按各自离散表切换。实际顶层负荷输出名为 loadProfileOutput，绘图时应使用此名。','The default load interpolation rises, holds and falls, while command and mode follow their discrete schedules. The actual top-level load output is named loadProfileOutput; use that name when plotting.'),['loadProfileOutput','commandOutput','modeOutput'],('只把停机边界从 5 s 移到 6 s，并同步修改三张表，检查任务语义是否保持一致。','Move the shutdown boundary from 5 to 6 s in all three schedules and check their consistency.'),('表之间没有自动同步修改机制；一张表变化后其余表仍保留原设置。','The schedules do not automatically update each other; changing one leaves the others unchanged.')),
'MultiphaseMission':ex(('四阶段任务与局部时间','Four phases and phase-local time'),('阶段编号、阶段内计时和任务完成如何相互对应？','How do phase index, local phase time and mission completion relate?'),('PhaseSchedule 使用边界 {0,1,3,7,10} 与四个阶段标识；PhaseLoad 根据阶段编号和局部时间产生 demand。','PhaseSchedule uses boundaries {0,1,3,7,10} and four phase identities. PhaseLoad derives demand from phase index and local time.'),('在 1、3、7 s 进入新阶段并重新开始阶段局部时间；10 s 后完成，phaseIndex 回到非活动状态。finished 只表示计划完成。','New phases begin at 1, 3 and 7 s with restarted phase-local time. After 10 s the plan is completed and phaseIndex returns to its inactive state. finished indicates plan completion only.'),['schedule.phaseIndex','schedule.localTime','demand','finished'],('把第二阶段延长 1 s，并检查后续边界和 PhaseLoad 假设是否也需要调整。','Extend phase two by 1 s and check subsequent boundaries and the assumptions inside PhaseLoad.'),('改变阶段长度可能改变负荷剖面的连续性；应同时检查阶段映射实现。','Changing a phase duration can alter profile continuity; inspect the mapping implementation as well.')),
'PhaseQualifiedWindows':ex(('阶段窗口与绝对窗口的一致性','Consistency of phase and absolute windows'),('何时可以用阶段条件代替绝对时间门控？','When can phase qualification replace absolute time gating?'),('阶段边界为 {0,2,5,8}，目标阶段为第二阶段；独立 TimeWindow 为 [2,5)，LocalClock 从 2 s 开始并在 5 s 停止。','Phase boundaries are {0,2,5,8} with phase two selected. The independent TimeWindow is [2,5); LocalClock starts at 2 s and stops at 5 s.'),('phaseActive 与 timeActive 应在 [2,5) 同为真；localElapsed 从零增长至 3 后保持。5 s 恰在窗口外。','phaseActive and timeActive should both be true over [2,5). localElapsed grows from zero to 3 and then holds. Exactly 5 s is outside the window.'),['phaseActive','timeActive','localElapsed'],('改变阶段边界但不改变 TimeWindow，观察原先等价的两个窗口如何不再一致。','Change phase boundaries without changing TimeWindow and observe the loss of equivalence.'),('阶段驱动与绝对时间等价依赖于当前时间表，不是通用恒等关系。','Equivalence depends on this timetable; it is not a general identity.')),
'RepeatedEventsAndDwell':ex(('事件计数、驻留确认与重触发','Event counting, dwell qualification and retriggering'),('短脉冲、持续条件和计划事件为何有不同计数？','Why do short pulses, sustained conditions and scheduled events produce different counts?'),('计划事件在 1、2、4 s，标识为 11、22、44。条件脉冲为 [1,1.2) 与 [2,2.7)，驻留要求 0.3 s；局部时钟可由上升沿重新触发。','Scheduled events occur at 1, 2 and 4 s with identities 11, 22 and 44. Condition pulses span [1,1.2) and [2,2.7), with 0.3 s dwell. The local clock can retrigger on rising edges.'),('第一脉冲不足驻留，不计确认；第二脉冲约在 2.3 s 确认一次。最终 plannedCount=3、dwellCount=1；elapsed 在两次条件上升沿重新开始。','The first pulse is too short and yields no qualification. The second qualifies once at approximately 2.3 s. Final plannedCount is 3 and dwellCount is 1; elapsed restarts at both rising edges.'),['plannedCount','dwellCount','dwell.fired','elapsed'],('把 dwellTime 改为 0.1，比较第一脉冲是否计入；再关闭 retrigger 检查局部时钟。','Set dwellTime to 0.1 and check the first pulse, then disable retrigger and inspect the local clock.'),('fired 的持续状态与单个事件计数不同，不应按每个采样点把真值重复累计。','A sustained fired state differs from an event count; do not count every true sample as a new event.'))
},
'study':[
('把场景与本体分开放在自己的研究包中，给任务输入、环境边界和初始化配置取明确名称。共享场景时只共享计划信号和配置数据，不要意外把两个本体的物理端口连成一个网络。','Separate scenario and host in your study package and give mission inputs, boundaries and initialisation configurations explicit names. Share planned signals and configuration data, not physical connections that unintentionally merge two hosts.'),
('下方模型演示从零新建一个斜坡任务和一阶本体。随后可以替换 host，但保持 scenario 设置不变，建立公平的比较条件。','The following model builds a ramp mission and a first-order host from scratch. Replace host while preserving scenario settings to maintain comparable experimental conditions.')],
'snippet':'''within;
model MyScheduledStudy
  ScenarioLibrary.Profiles.Ramp scenario(height=1, startTime=0.5, duration=1.5);
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.FirstOrder host(
    T=0.4, y_start=0, initType=Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialState);
equation
  connect(scenario.y, host.u);
  annotation(experiment(StartTime=0, StopTime=6, Tolerance=1e-6));
end MyScheduledStudy;''',
 'trouble':[
(('填写了 record，本体为什么没变化','Why did the record not change the host?'),'检查字段是否实际绑定到本体修饰项。record 不是自动搜索并配置组件的程序，未引用的记录不会影响方程。','Check that fields are bound into host modifiers. A record does not search for and configure components; an unreferenced record has no effect on the equations.'),
(('阶段结束时多触发一次','Why did an event occur at a phase boundary?'),'检查左闭右开的时间定义、右连续表值和事件计数逻辑。输出网格上的重复时刻可能表示事件前后两侧，不应先删掉再判断时序。','Check half-open windows, right-continuous values and event-count logic. Repeated timestamps in output may represent the two sides of an event; do not remove them before interpreting timing.'),
(('初始化过约束或不一致','Initialisation is overconstrained or inconsistent'),'检查是否固定了连接约束已经决定的从属变量，以及本体是否另外指定 SteadyState 或固定初始方程。先固定独立状态，再让从属量由方程计算。','Check fixed dependent variables and any additional SteadyState or fixed initial equations in the host. Fix independent states and let equations determine dependent quantities.'),
(('环境信号与物理响应不一致','Environmental signal does not affect the plant'),'检查信号是否接到实际边界或受力关系；单独绘出 300 K、风速或坡度并不表示已作用到本体。','Check connection to the actual boundary or force relation. Plotting a temperature, wind speed or grade does not show that it acts on the plant.')]
}
